      "ImageDescription": {
        "value": "Navy File Photo – Cdr. Charles \"Swede\" Momsen stands next to the rail (third from left) as USS Falcon (ASR 2) crewmen suit-up two Deep Sea Divers during the rescue/salvage operation following the sinking of the U.S. Navy submarine USS Squalus (SS 192). Momsen led the successful effort, which resulted in the rescue of 33 submariners trapped aboard Squalus and remains to this day the greatest undersea rescue in history. U.S. Navy photo.  (RELEASED)",
        "source": "commons-desc-page"
      },
